              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amubone! Alya azilundu alamvwigwa maulu aasikukambauka Makani Mabotu, uuteelezya luumuno. Wati, Kobamba mapobwe aako, O Juda, kocita mbowakonkezya. Mwana wa-Saatani takooyooinda limbi akati kako, nkaambo wamanisigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.15",
